(7695732, 1261985, 67145, '<td valign="top">i dont even care that this has a less than awesome title .. <br/>your photo makes up for that in spades .. <br/>which is a weird saying when you think of it .. why not in hearts .. i will have to google the origins .. <br/>anyway .. good luck in the challenge .. <br/>this is totally wonderful .. :)<br/> <br/>fyi .. i googled it .. <br/>" Spades is the highest ranking suits in the game of Contract Bridge, a very popular pastime in the USA in the early 20th century, which is when and where the phrase originated."</td>', 'i dont even care that this has a less than awesome title .. your photo makes up for that in spades .. which is a weird saying when you think of it .. why not in hearts .. i will have to google the origins .. anyway .. good luck in the challenge .. this is totally wonderful .. :) fyi .. i googled it .. " Spades is the highest ranking suits in the game of Contract Bridge, a very popular pastime in the USA in the early 20th century, which is when and where the phrase originated."', '2021-06-09 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
