(7695836, 1262041, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think sunsets are usually overrated, but I really like this one. The wide angle, the smooth water and reflections, the deep blue colors, the people, the sky. Wonderful.</td>', 'I think sunsets are usually overrated, but I really like this one. The wide angle, the smooth water and reflections, the deep blue colors, the people, the sky. Wonderful.', '2021-06-10 10:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
