(7696055, 1261777, 60581, '<td valign="top">I would have prefer to crop this from the left as I see that the top you still have space and left darker area is just causing the drop of eyes, otherwise definitely a good find and good alignment of the shot.</td>', 'I would have prefer to crop this from the left as I see that the top you still have space and left darker area is just causing the drop of eyes, otherwise definitely a good find and good alignment of the shot.', '2021-06-15 08:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7696056, 1261985, 60581, '<td valign="top">I am wondering how this would have looked if the sun was more lower and coming full in the frame. Good catch on the shot though, I am waiting to take a shot like this just don''t know where I will find these beautiful earth friend.</td>', 'I am wondering how this would have looked if the sun was more lower and coming full in the frame. Good catch on the shot though, I am waiting to take a shot like this just don''t know where I will find these beautiful earth friend.', '2021-06-15 08:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
