(7696090, 1262078, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lot to appreciate in this orange soaked image.  The top and bottom layers frame the central sky, mountains and wind turbines.  The turbines take on the aspect of technological calligraphy, or semaphores.  They contrast subtly, but pointedly, with the birds.  The sparkling bottom layer contrasts nicely with the smoothness of the upper portions.  All of a piece, a lovely one at that.</td>', 'A lot to appreciate in this orange soaked image.  The top and bottom layers frame the central sky, mountains and wind turbines.  The turbines take on the aspect of technological calligraphy, or semaphores.  They contrast subtly, but pointedly, with the birds.  The sparkling bottom layer contrasts nicely with the smoothness of the upper portions.  All of a piece, a lovely one at that.', '2021-06-16 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696091, 1261985, 173844, '<td valign="top">Like copper or gold embossed oriental art.  It all blends together beautifully, the colors, the grace, the mood.  The reeds and cranes gently echo each other, a nuanced, genteel dance.  The brightness of the sun nicely transitions to rich browns, keeping the the elements in silhouette. <br/>Could be a portion of an endless scroll.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Like copper or gold embossed oriental art.  It all blends together beautifully, the colors, the grace, the mood.  The reeds and cranes gently echo each other, a nuanced, genteel dance.  The brightness of the sun nicely transitions to rich browns, keeping the the elements in silhouette. Could be a portion of an endless scroll.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-06-16 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696092, 1262089, 173844, '<td valign="top">A beautiful bowl of poppies holding the sky.  A marvelous breakfast.</td>', 'A beautiful bowl of poppies holding the sky.  A marvelous breakfast.', '2021-06-16 11:34:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696093, 1262019, 60581, '<td valign="top">I am writing an how-to of this to show how I took the shot and what all I did to know about situation :)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice capture, Girish! Where did you take it from? </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I am writing an how-to of this to show how I took the shot and what all I did to know about situation :) Originally posted by LevT: Nice capture, Girish! Where did you take it from? ', '2021-06-16 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696094, 1262071, 173844, '<td valign="top">An intimate glimpse of a cozy room, lit by the sun peeking in.  The casual assemblage fits together like a complex jigsaw puzzle, especially color-wise.  The computer screen, in my opinion, is jarring.  On the other hand, though, I love the red, trapezoidal lampshade, which might also be seen as jarring.  It''s a soft brightness, and it beautifully lights the painting behind it.  The view out the left hand window opens the scene up, partner to the sun-filled window.  Captivating.  Also, nice title.</td>', 'An intimate glimpse of a cozy room, lit by the sun peeking in.  The casual assemblage fits together like a complex jigsaw puzzle, especially color-wise.  The computer screen, in my opinion, is jarring.  On the other hand, though, I love the red, trapezoidal lampshade, which might also be seen as jarring.  It''s a soft brightness, and it beautifully lights the painting behind it.  The view out the left hand window opens the scene up, partner to the sun-filled window.  Captivating.  Also, nice title.', '2021-06-16 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696095, 1262086, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pelicans are such startling, wonderful birds, and to see this multitude of them is joyous and heartwarming.  They do mighty well in silhouette.  In a way, they remind me here of windblown dandelion seeds.  Handsome image.</td>', 'Pelicans are such startling, wonderful birds, and to see this multitude of them is joyous and heartwarming.  They do mighty well in silhouette.  In a way, they remind me here of windblown dandelion seeds.  Handsome image.', '2021-06-16 11:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696096, 1262078, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very nice, Sarah! Congrats!</td>', 'Very nice, Sarah! Congrats!', '2021-06-16 12:04:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696097, 1262069, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stunning image in its sharpness and insistence.  Great angles, including the curves that are actually straight out of the strong wide angle lens.  The sky and clouds of this time of day are terrific.  The grain works really well.  The mood, at least as I feel it, is of a full quiet, but ready to spring open.  That''s the drama of it.  Very strong.  Gave it an 8.  Sorry, deserves a 10.</td>', 'Stunning image in its sharpness and insistence.  Great angles, including the curves that are actually straight out of the strong wide angle lens.  The sky and clouds of this time of day are terrific.  The grain works really well.  The mood, at least as I feel it, is of a full quiet, but ready to spring open.  That''s the drama of it.  Very strong.  Gave it an 8.  Sorry, deserves a 10.', '2021-06-16 12:05:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696098, 1262036, 2333, '<td valign="top">Congrats Barry! This was one of my favs for the challenge. Just love the summer vibe this invokes.</td>', 'Congrats Barry! This was one of my favs for the challenge. Just love the summer vibe this invokes.', '2021-06-16 12:05:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696099, 1262080, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Looks like a scene of biblical creation.  The colors are strong yet somehow constrained.  I do like the dark shore, but perhaps, in my humble opinion, too green.  In any case, this is how it begins.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Looks like a scene of biblical creation.  The colors are strong yet somehow constrained.  I do like the dark shore, but perhaps, in my humble opinion, too green.  In any case, this is how it begins.', '2021-06-16 12:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696100, 1262088, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, charming, full of optimism.  Underscores how precious every atom is, in the majesty of the whole, and exemplified in nature as it sustains us.  The colors are exquisite.  Would the entire world be so.</td>', 'Beautiful, charming, full of optimism.  Underscores how precious every atom is, in the majesty of the whole, and exemplified in nature as it sustains us.  The colors are exquisite.  Would the entire world be so.', '2021-06-16 12:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696101, 1262025, 173844, '<td valign="top">Despite your self-depredation, I find this photo to be marvelous.  The blues are gorgeous.  The sun is gorgeous, overwhelming in its generous embrace.  I love how the noise imbues it with a fine, shimmering texture.  This feels like the ultima Thule, where secrets can finally be revealed.  The perspective is awesome.  Thank you.</td>', 'Despite your self-depredation, I find this photo to be marvelous.  The blues are gorgeous.  The sun is gorgeous, overwhelming in its generous embrace.  I love how the noise imbues it with a fine, shimmering texture.  This feels like the ultima Thule, where secrets can finally be revealed.  The perspective is awesome.  Thank you.', '2021-06-16 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696103, 1262091, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome, moody image.  I love the purple toning.  The depth and reach are wonderful.  The sun''s rays are glorious.  Really takes one''s breath away.</td>', 'Handsome, moody image.  I love the purple toning.  The depth and reach are wonderful.  The sun''s rays are glorious.  Really takes one''s breath away.', '2021-06-16 12:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7696112, 1262019, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pgirish007:</b></div><hr/><i> I am writing an how-to of this to show how I took the shot and what all I did to know about situation :)</i></td></tr></table> I''ve read your notes in the forum, and the alignment issue is pretty clear. What I really was asking is how did you get this high vantage point? Is it a drone shot? I thought you cannot fly drones in the middle of Manhattan, but I could be wrong of course :)</td>', 'Originally posted by pgirish007: I am writing an how-to of this to show how I took the shot and what all I did to know about situation :) I''ve read your notes in the forum, and the alignment issue is pretty clear. What I really was asking is how did you get this high vantage point? Is it a drone shot? I thought you cannot fly drones in the middle of Manhattan, but I could be wrong of course :)', '2021-06-16 19:08:39.000000', NULL, 0),
