(7696114, 1262019, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pgirish007:</b></div><hr/><i> My bad :(<br/> <br/>it is a bridge and I standing on that and <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/@40.7490685,-73.9704289,3a,75y,303.16h,102.35t/data=!3m8!1e1!3m6!1sAF1QipNmKA3Off-pnZQUqipa_KtgLyxAzG9WanWTdHYk!2e10!3e11!6shttps:%2F%2Flh5.googleusercontent.com%2Fp%2FAF1QipNmKA3Off-pnZQUqipa_KtgLyxAzG9WanWTdHYk%3Dw203-h100-k-no-pi-0-ya179.58289-ro0-fo100!7i9728!8i4864" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here the link</a> of someone else''s view point on google map</i></td></tr></table> I see now, thank you! Great placement of the bridge, very thoughtful of us photographers :).</td>', 'Originally posted by pgirish007: My bad :( it is a bridge and I standing on that and here the link of someone else''s view point on google map I see now, thank you! Great placement of the bridge, very thoughtful of us photographers :).', '2021-06-16 19:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
